		{"id":"8c985a35a7a99a05","x":1028,"y":1000,"width":804,"height":432,"type":"group","label":"Player Win"},
		{"id":"126b376b46c9253d","type":"group","x":-580,"y":-600,"width":980,"height":170,"label":"Legend"},
		{"id":"6c200c7e75f51fe5","type":"text","text":"# **KEY**","x":-560,"y":-580,"width":125,"height":50},
		{"id":"5f0fa7530a9690b8","type":"text","text":"# SFX","x":-560,"y":-510,"width":125,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"15aeea00ca48b244","type":"text","text":"# Scene Description","x":-400,"y":-510,"width":300,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"cd0ea68de1974297","type":"text","text":"# Dialogue","x":-60,"y":-510,"width":200,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"fedc0fce90ade60e","type":"text","text":"# Flow","x":176,"y":-510,"width":200,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"b766a15e743dfcb9","type":"text","text":"A sturdy looking man in a pink suit bellows:","x":-435,"y":-294,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"767b5f273a9c0ce3","type":"text","text":"\"He can't have gone far, keep looking!\"","x":-435,"y":-229,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"7779807c22000365","type":"text","text":"Wide shot panning across the alley\nIn the corner, a young man hides hugging his uber eats delivery pack","x":-435,"y":-100,"width":298,"height":170,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"2f7707486ca3af46","type":"text","text":"\"There you are punk! Hand over the card you swiped\"","x":-423,"y":70,"width":274,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"91c6f0e659c1da79","type":"text","text":"Man crouching in the foreground, while 3 pink dudes stand behind him","x":18,"y":-100,"width":298,"height":100,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"eaf45f78fb5253fd","type":"text","text":"A gang of pink dudes running down the alleyway","x":30,"y":-300,"width":270,"height":71,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"4c24fffa66c0af80","type":"text","text":"\n**Young man**: I.. I don't know what you're talking about\n**Hawaiian shirt**: You ain't gonna fool me, I saw you take it with my own two eyes\n**Button up shirt**: We can do this the easy way, or the fun way\n\n**Player**: It wasn't me!  I don't have any card!\n**Button up shirt**: I was hoping you'd take the fun way\n","x":30,"y":0,"width":270,"height":380,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"3b5cdf106bbde4ec","type":"text","text":"Knuckles crack","x":82,"y":380,"width":166,"height":63,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"51cfb063dbac9873","type":"text","text":"Running","x":98,"y":-229,"width":135,"height":50,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"2c8ee0dd43d9557c","type":"text","text":"## Start of level:\n\nPlayer base ability:\n\n- sluggish movement\n- dash costs stamina\n- melee attacks\n\nvs 2 gang dudes & boss\n\n- gang dudes have similar base ability as player\n- Boss has heavy telegraphed attacks\n- gang dudes will try to surround the player and push towards boss\n\n## Boss special attacks\n\nWhen the player stay nearby for a long time:\n\n- He chokes the player with one hand and raises them\n- The player can mash buttons to get out (button indicator will show up)\n- If they fail to escape, they will be slammed on the ground\n- The gang dudes will kick you while you're on the ground\n\nWhen the player stays far away:\n\n- Hunch over and charge at the player\n- Player can spin to escape\n- If they fail, they will be slammed on the wall\n- If the player escape near the wall, the boss will run into the wall, take damage, and get stunned","x":820,"y":-308,"width":590,"height":784},
		{"id":"dfdd4d4ac64685c7","type":"text","text":"3 dudes lay sprawled on the ground","x":1568,"y":1039,"width":244,"height":56,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"eac8593cfd0c02de","type":"text","text":"Reinforcement shows up finding the 2 men and the boss on the ground","x":1168,"y":1020,"width":260,"height":95,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"8fb3f76e0d7a125b","type":"text","text":"Police Sirens + Running","x":1173,"y":1115,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"b4efac47292fc155","type":"text","text":"Player hidden behind window opens his package and takes out shiny card","x":1176,"y":1279,"width":244,"height":133,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"9abfc2f2f6bf7ae9","type":"text","text":"\n**Hawaiian shirt**: Uhh, boss? Why ya looking at me like that? \n**Boss**: I don't tolerate mistakes, Jim \n**Hawaiian shirt**: I swear boss! It was him!","x":-117,"y":1205,"width":285,"height":220,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"4e0dda015351cbe4","type":"text","text":"They pour out the contents A couple of burgers, chips, plastic cups and softdrinks spills all over the ground","x":-105,"y":820,"width":260,"height":140,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"f6dac9e2afd7d0b5","type":"text","text":"\n**Boss**: There's nothing here but junk","x":-100,"y":960,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"b69036096ed7e1ee","type":"text","text":"Half body of hawaiian shirt, with boss's shadow looming over him","x":-100,"y":1105,"width":250,"height":100,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"8245bea09f71a199","type":"text","text":"\n**Boss**: We'll discuss back at HQ","x":293,"y":1265,"width":273,"height":80,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"c19229292e15cbde","type":"text","text":"He reaches under the burger patty and pulls out a shiny card","x":304,"y":1560,"width":262,"height":100,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"313ae56be119bfbf","type":"text","text":"Gang opens delivery package","x":298,"y":865,"width":244,"height":50,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"50386da87fe668e6","type":"text","text":"The gang turns away as the player lays stomach down on the ground","x":298,"y":1105,"width":262,"height":100,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"1962791339ca8d7c","type":"text","text":"Police Sirens","x":304,"y":1205,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"e62f37c9a6bb1ed5","x":551,"y":2040,"width":859,"height":480,"type":"text","text":"The unblocked chain network allows users to earn rewards by using their excess compute.\n\n_The compute bar appears on your HUD and slowly fills up_\n\nYou can boost the compute power of your node by \"overclocking\". Try \"overclocking\" that training dummy over there.\n\n_Training dummy materialises in the middle of the area_\n\nOnce you have reached the required amount of compute, the network will calculate and distribute the rewards directly to you. Keep \"overclocking\" to build up your unblocked chain and improve your reward.\n\n- Dealing damage to enemies will speed up the compute bar, and raise the \"chain\" counter\n- The chain counter will slowly tick down if there is no activity\n- The chain counter will go down by a set amount when hit by an attack\n- Once the compute bar fills up, it triggers a slot machine which takes 5-10 seconds to spin\n- Once the slot machine is done spinning, the reward will be modified by the highest chain counter reached during the spin\n- certain rewards also have a special animation/cut scene"}
	],
